[q('Why was the quiet hour introduced?','To reduce customer enquiries','To provide reliable time for focused work','To shorten the working day',1,'predictable period … requiring concentration が主目的。faster は明確に否定。'),q('How can a team change its quiet hour?','By getting agreement from every member','By asking customers','By cancelling all meetings permanently',0,'if all members agree。全員の同意が条件。')],
