[q('What can be concluded from the survey?','Garden users reported less stress','The garden definitely reduced everyone’s stress','Garden users worked longer hours',0,'reported lower stress は観察事実。因果関係は本文で否定されている。'),q('Why will the next survey ask about workload?','To close the garden','To examine another possible explanation','To stop employees taking breaks',1,'lighter workloads が別の説明となり得るため。')],
